  "description": "<p data-start=\"42\" data-end=\"298\">De Canon PowerShot DSC-H9 is een compacte digitale camera met krachtige zoommogelijkheden. Dankzij de gebruiksvriendelijke bediening en veelzijdige functies is deze camera geschikt voor het maken van foto’s tijdens reizen, evenementen of dagelijks gebruik.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"300\" data-end=\"309\">Staat</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"310\" data-end=\"328\"><strong data-start=\"310\" data-end=\"328\">In Nette Staat</strong></p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"330\" data-end=\"345\">⭐ Voordelen</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"346\" data-end=\"496\">\r\n<li data-start=\"346\" data-end=\"375\">\r\n<p data-start=\"348\" data-end=\"375\">⭐ Krachtige optische zoom</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"376\" data-end=\"419\">\r\n<p data-start=\"378\" data-end=\"419\">⭐ Geschikt voor foto’s en video-opnames</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"420\" data-end=\"456\">\r\n<p data-start=\"422\" data-end=\"456\">⭐ Gebruiksvriendelijke bediening</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"457\" data-end=\"496\">\r\n<p data-start=\"459\" data-end=\"496\">⭐ Compact en makkelijk mee te nemen</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"498\" data-end=\"518\">📋 Specificaties</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"519\" data-end=\"813\">\r\n<li data-start=\"519\" data-end=\"563\">\r\n<p data-start=\"521\" data-end=\"563\"><strong data-start=\"521\" data-end=\"538\">Merk & model:</strong> Canon PowerShot DSC-H9</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"564\" data-end=\"591\">\r\n<p data-start=\"566\" data-end=\"591\"><strong data-start=\"566\" data-end=\"575\">Type:</strong> Compactcamera</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"592\" data-end=\"622\">\r\n<p data-start=\"594\" data-end=\"622\"><strong data-start=\"594\" data-end=\"608\">Resolutie:</strong> 8 megapixel</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"623\" data-end=\"649\">\r\n<p data-start=\"625\" data-end=\"649\"><strong data-start=\"625\" data-end=\"643\">Optische zoom:</strong> 15×</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"650\" data-end=\"681\">\r\n<p data-start=\"652\" data-end=\"681\"><strong data-start=\"652\" data-end=\"662\">Video:</strong> VGA video-opname</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"682\" data-end=\"708\">\r\n<p data-start=\"684\" data-end=\"708\"><strong data-start=\"684\" data-end=\"695\">Scherm:</strong> 3 inch LCD</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"709\" data-end=\"748\">\r\n<p data-start=\"711\" data-end=\"748\"><strong data-start=\"711\" data-end=\"730\">Connectiviteit:</strong> USB, AV-uitgang</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"749\" data-end=\"783\">\r\n<p data-start=\"751\" data-end=\"783\"><strong data-start=\"751\" data-end=\"761\">Kleur:</strong> Niet gespecificeerd</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"784\" data-end=\"813\">\r\n<p data-start=\"786\" data-end=\"813\"><strong data-start=\"786\" data-end=\"796\">Staat:</strong> In Nette Staat</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"815\" data-end=\"833\">📦 Meegeleverd</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"834\" data-end=\"844\">\r\n<li data-start=\"834\" data-end=\"844\">\r\n<p data-start=\"836\" data-end=\"844\">Camera</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"846\" data-end=\"868\">🛡️ Incl. Garantie</h3>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p data-start=\"869\" data-end=\"901\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Incl. Garantie: 1 maand garantie</p>",
